graph TD
    P[PROVISIONING] --> R[RUNNING]
    R --> Q[QUIESCING]
    Q --> S[STOPPED]
    R --> F[FAILED]
    F --> RC[RECOVERING]
    RC --> R
    Q -->|Drain or interrupt; flush state| V[Persist workspace and SDK state]
    V --> S
    RC -->|Fence stale runtime and credentials| L[Acquire new lease and generation]
    L --> M[Attach durable volume; restore SDK session]
    M --> R
    S -->|Resume request| M
    V --> B[(Backups and durable volume)]
